{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">STRIK-9 fuses the frantic, rewarding chaos of Bullet Heaven games with Rhythm action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into a tale of adventure and comical hijinks! Join Strik and his pals, a band of music-loving critters, as they journey through a dystopian wasteland controlled by a rhythm-obsessed hive mind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Their mission? Fight the synchronized oppression and search for epic tunes to bring life back to the world, one beat at a time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Rhythm Meets Roguelite</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Beat-Based Combat</strong> \u2013 Attack, dodge, and unleash special moves only if you stay on beat.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/gift_combat.gif?t=1753365478\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Progression That Plays Well</strong> \u2013 Unlock new companions who bring new abilities to the battlefield across multiple runs.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/gift_UI.gif?t=1753365478\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Built-in Level Editor</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft your own rhythmic arenas, enemy patterns, and musical showdowns.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3642210/extras/level_editor.gif?t=1753365478\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Story Woven in Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a music-fueled mystery where the soundtrack isn\u2019t just background\u2014it\u2019s the key to saving a world ruled by rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_p